*Key Formulae:*
- Partial fractions: $1 / ((1 + u)(4 - u)) = 1/5 (1 / (1 + u) + 1 / (4 - u))$
- Outer geometric expansion: $1 / (z^2 - a) = 1 / z^2 sum_(n=0)^oo (a / z^2)^n$ for $|z|^2 > |a|$
